issuer.","case .deactivated:","    \/\/ Card deactivated.","case .unknown:","    \/\/ State could not be determined.","}"]},{"anchor":"Wallet-Extension","level":2,"type":"heading","text":"Wallet Extension"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"In addition to in-app provisioning, you can let cardholders provision cards directly from the Apple Wallet app. When configured, your app appears in Wallet’s "},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"From Apps on Your iPhone"}]},{"type":"text","text":" section."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The Sessions approach provides a high-level base class, "},{"code":"WalletExtensionHandler","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":", that handles the full extension flow. You subclass it and override a small set of methods."}]},{"anchor":"Prerequisites","level":3,"type":"heading","text":"Prerequisites"},{"type":"orderedList","items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"In-app provisioning must be working first."}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The "},{"code":"com.apple.developer.payment-pass-provisioning","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" entitlement must be present on the main app, Non-UI Extension, and UI Extension targets."}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A shared keychain access group must be configured (the same "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"keychainAccessGroup"},{"text":" you passed to ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Configuration"},{"type":"text","text":")."}]}]}]},{"level":3,"type":"heading","text":"Step 1: Create the Non-UI Extension Target","anchor":"Step-1-Create-the-Non-UI-Extension-Target"},{"items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"In Xcode, go to "},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"File > New > Target","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":" and select "},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"Action Extension","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Remove all generated files except "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Info.plist"},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"In "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Info.plist"},{"type":"text","text":", find the "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"NSExtension"},{"type":"text","text":" dictionary and set:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"header":"row","rows":[[[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Key"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Type"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Value"}],"type":"paragraph"}]],[[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"NSExtensionPointIdentifier"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"String","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"com.apple.PassKit.issuer-provisioning"}],"type":"paragraph"}]],[[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"NSExtensionPrincipalClass"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"String"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"code":"$(PRODUCT_MODULE_NAME).MyWalletExtensionHandler","type":"codeVoice"}]}]]],"type":"table"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Add the "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"com.apple.developer.payment-pass-provisioning"},{"type":"text","text":" entitlement."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Add the "},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Keychain Sharing"}]},{"type":"text","text":" entitlement ("},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"com.apple.security.keychain-access-groups"},{"type":"text","text":") and include the same access group identifier you pass to "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"keychainAccessGroup"},{"type":"text","tex